OL,3,GNEWSACumbria's highest inn will remain
OL,4,Apub, owner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FJerry Huppert, co-owner of Supreme
OL,7,FEscapes, said "there was absolutely no
OL,8,Fintention on our part to remove or lose
OL,9,Fthe pub", while the brewery said it
OL,10,Fwould continue its operations at its
OL,11,FRoyal Barn site in Kirkby Lonsdale.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
